<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The Amperly mark, for in-app use.

  Same artwork as the launcher icon — the gradient A with the lane-dashed road across it and
  the plug on its cable — drawn on a 24dp grid so it lines up with the rest of the icon set.
  The group scales the 108dp artwork down and centres the mark (x 25.5-84, y 28.5-85.5) in the
  24dp box, so the two can never drift apart.

  It keeps its own gradient rather than being tinted: the green-to-blue sweep is the logo.
-->
